Do you think you know a lot? Our quiz game will help you test your knowledge on a variety of topics, such as: geography, history, science, music, cinema and many others!

It’s okay if you don’t know the answers to some questions, you can use hints or skip questions, as well as we will not deprive you of “lives” for incorrect answers, you can play until you get bored.

The application has features such as:

- Two types of questions: with four possible answers and “true or false”;

- A lot of different categories and topics, such as: geography, history, music, fashion, science, etc.;

- Ability to use a hint or skip questions if you do not know the correct answer;

